  ],
  "translation": "Ndũkũgĩka, thutha wa mũthamaki kuigua ⟨את⟩ kĩrĩra kĩa mũndũ wa Erohimu, kĩrĩa oigĩtie kũng'ũra mũgiro wa Betheeri, Yarobohamu nĩarotĩte ⟨את⟩ moko make kuuma igũrũ rĩa mũgiro, akiuga: Mũnyitani ⟨mũndũ ũcio⟩! Moko make arĩa oorotie kũmũ nĩmakambĩrĩkĩte, ndangĩhota kũgĩcookerera kũrĩa.",
